  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 52e4a196ade8fa64b94cade3bdeb555c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Popup_Level02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoPopupData
  popupId: level02_intro
  pages:
  - title: Level 2 - Fire hazard
    body: The electrical sockets in this house are faulty. A spark sets the finished wooden floor around it on fire.
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Fix it before it sparks
    body: "A faulty socket <b>crackles</b> for a few seconds before it sparks. Walk up to it and press <b>E</b> to fix it in time - no fire at all.\n\nA loyal dog runs to you and barks at a socket that's about to go."
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Put it out
    body: "Missed it? Buy a <b>Fire Extinguisher</b> from the shop, carry it to the fire and press <b>Q</b> to spray.\n\nBurning tiles lose health. If a tile burns for too long it breaks and you have to build it again."
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Stay safe
    body: Don't walk through the flames. Fire spreads to the wooden tiles next to it, so react early - a small fire is much easier to handle than a burning room.
    image: {fileID: 0}
